This product uses the SCIP Optimization Suite developed at
Zuse Institute Berlin (https://www.scipopt.org/) and the HiGHS
optimization solver (https://highs.dev/).

It also ships two command-line solvers as separate programs: CBC
(https://github.com/coin-or/Cbc, EPL-2.0) and GLPK
(https://www.gnu.org/software/glpk/, GPL-3.0-or-later). Neither is
linked into JAOT; both are run as their own processes and exchange
data through files.

Third-party license attributions are documented in THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.
